WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.630
This query writes the cumulative frame explicitly It
starts at

00:00:05.656 --> 00:00:11.202
the first row of the ordered partition and ends at
the current row Writing

00:00:11.229 --> 00:00:17.218
the frame makes the intended behavior visible to the
reader That is especially

00:00:17.244 --> 00:00:20.889
useful in teaching and in production queries where
the frame meaning matters
